A '''Tourist''' (Japanese: '''ツアーきゃく''' ''Tourist'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VI]]. They are depicted as people from other regions traveling to and staying in [[Kalos]] for leisure. As they represent the large number of Japanese tourists that visit France, most of them have Japanese names. A male Tourist and a young female Tourist are called {{tc|Honeymooners}}.

They are very similar to the {{tc|Sightseer}} {{DL|Pokémon Trainer|Trainer class}}, who took their place in {{g|Legends: Z-A}}.

They use any Pokémon not introduced in Generations [[Generation V|V]] or [[Generation VI|VI]] (due to them not being based on regions in Japan while [[Kanto]], [[Johto]], [[Hoenn]] and [[Sinnoh]] were)

